body: "The `release` job of the Daily Release workflow failed.\n\n- Failing job: `release`\n- Run URL: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/actions/runs/40177103103\n- Commit: c7faa1a269675152172a70fbf87fddd9410c5475\n- Date (UTC): 2026-10-25T09:39:54Z\n\n\n---\n\n### GitHub comments (3)\n\n> **@github-actions[bot]** (2026-10-25T10:18:22Z)\n>\n> The `release` job of the Daily Release workflow failed.\n> \n> - Failing job: `release`\n> - Run URL: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/actions/runs/40177103103\n> - Commit: c7faa1a269675152172a70fbf87fddd9410c5475\n> - Date (UTC): 2026-10-25T10:18:20Z\n> \n\n> **@github-actions[bot]** (2026-10-25T10:47:31Z)\n>\n> The `release` job of the Daily Release workflow failed.\n> \n> - Failing job: `release`\n> - Run URL: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-brief/actions/runs/40177103103\n> - Commit: c7faa1a269675152172a70fbf87fddd9410c5475\n> - Date (UTC): 2026-10-25T10:47:28Z\n> \n\n> **@unbraind** (2026-10-25T23:08:40Z)\n>\n> Recovered: the 2026-10-25 run failed only at \"Merge release metadata through protected PR\". The release PR's required checks were still queued when the 30-minute merge wait expired, because the runner pool was saturated; no check failed. The run was re-run (or, where main had advanced, dispatched fresh), and v2026.10.25 is published: npm `pm-brief@2026.10.25` and GitHub Release v2026.10.25 (2026-10-25T11:48:47Z). Future runs that fail this way are recovered automatically by the host-side release re-run sweep (unbraind/pm-cli-companion#273)."
